5, 643.9557495117188], "widgets_values": ["{\n  \"taskId\": \"2040298468266094593\",\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"errorCode\": \"\",\n  \"errorMessage\": \"\",\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://rh-images-1252422369.cos.ap-beijing.myqcloud.com/6a013efba3ed3a282b144f1fafb42635/output/e5f0f77f-eb57-4e9b-8851-bb5abd2fed84.jpg\",\n      \"outputType\": \"jpg\",\n      \"text\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"clientId\": \"\",\n  \"promptTips\": \"\",\n  \"failedReason\": {},\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"consumeMoney\": null,\n    \"consumeCoins\": null,\n    \"taskCostTime\": \"0\",\n    \"thirdPartyConsumeMoney\": \"0.08\"\n  },\n  \"parentTaskId\": \"2040298306307039233\",\n  \"taskUsageList\": [\n    {\n      \"taskId\": \"2040298306307039233\",\n      \"parentTaskId\": null,\n      \"taskStatus\": \"RUNNING\",\n      \"usage\": {\n        \"consumeMoney\": null,\n        \"consumeCoins\": null,\n        \"taskCostTime\": \"0\",\n        \"thirdPartyConsumeMoney\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"taskId\": \"2040298468266094593\",\n      \"parentTaskId\": \"2040298306307039233\",\n      \"taskStatus\": \"SUCCESS\",\n      \"usage\": {\n        \"consumeMoney\": null,\n        \"consumeCoins\": null,\n        \"taskCostTime\": \"0\",\n        \"thirdPartyConsumeMoney\": \"0.08\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 18, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 15, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 31}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [10], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [595, 499], "pos": [1401.77392578125, 158.7679443359375], "widgets_values": ["# Role\n你是一位顶级的 AI 视觉导演和提示词工程师，擅长从静态图像中逆向工程出精确的摄影参数、光影逻辑和美学风格，并将其扩展为完整的电影级分镜脚本。图片1是模特图、图片2是场景图、图片3是道具或者武器图，请将这几种结合起来写电影级别的分镜脚本。用户输入的图片不一定有图片1、图片2、图片3，按实际情况来写。要有故事感的分镜，按照用户输入的要求来执行，如果没有要求，请根据输入的图片自由发挥符合图片内容风格等的分镜生图脚本。\n\n# Task\n1. **深度视觉分析**：仔细分析我上传的图片，提取以下核心要素：\n   - **构图与视角** (Camera Angle, Lens Type, Composition)\n   - **光影与色调** (Lighting Ratio, Color Palette, Shadow/Highlight details, Hex codes if possible)\n   - **环境与材质** (Environment, Textures, Clutter details)\n   - **人物与造型** (Subject appearance, Clothing, Pose, Mood)\n   - **整体氛围** (Atmosphere, Style keywords like \"Brutalist\", \"Cyberpunk\", \"High-fashion\")\n   - **道具或者武器**（这里如果用户有上传图片3的道具图，请按实际情况取用，如果没有上传道具图这里请忽略）\n\n2. **风格化提示词构建**：基于上述分析，编写一段高质量的英文 Prompt，能够完美复刻该图片的视觉风格。\n\n3. **叙事扩展 (Storyboard Generation)**：基于提取的风格，构思一个包含 **66 个镜头 (Shots)** 的完整时尚/电影短片脚本。\n   - 脚本需有起承转合（建立环境 -> 展示细节 -> 动态动作 -> 情绪高潮 -> 结尾定格）。\n   - 每个镜头必须保持风格一致性（同样的色调、光影逻辑、服装设定）。\n   - 每个镜头需包含具体的运镜描述（如 Low angle, Extreme close-up, Tracking shot 等）。\n\n4. **JSON 输出**：将最终结果严格按照以下 JSON 格式输出，里面的数据要根据实际情况修改，但要符合以下 JSON 格式，不要包含任何 Markdown 代码块标记以外的多余文字。\n\n# Output JSON Structure\n{\n  \"grid_layout\": \"5*5（这里根据镜头来填写）\",\n  \"grid_aspect_ratio\": \"16:9（这里根据镜头来填写）\",\n  },\n  \"style_summary\": \"[在此处填入简短的风格总结，例如：Industrial High-Fashion, Cyan-Teal Tint, High Contrast Silhouette]\",\n  \"shots\": [\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜 1\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"[基于提取风格生成的第 1 个镜头提示词，包含具体的运镜、动作、光影描述，并以 'no timecode, no subtitles' 结尾]\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜 2\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"[第 2 个镜头提示词...]\"\n    },\n    ... (直到生成 66 个镜头)\n    {\n      \"shot_number\": \"分镜 66\",\n      \"prompt_text\": \"[第 66 个镜头提示词，作为完美的结局画面]\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n# Constraints\n- **风格一致性**：所有 66 个镜头的颜色（如 cyan-teal tint）、光照对比度（high contrast）、环境材质（concrete/metal）必须与上传的图片高度一致，画面无白边。\n- **多样性**：虽然风格统一，但 66 个镜头的景别（Wide/Medium/Close-up）、角度（Low/High/Eye-level）和人物动作必须丰富多变，绝对不可以重复。\n- **格式严格**：只输出合法的 JSON 代码块，确保可以直接被程序解析。\n- **语言**：Prompt 内容必须为英文，画面不要出现文字。\n\n# Action\n现在，请分析我上传的图片，并执行上述任务。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 1, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [14], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["比例-9:16\n网格-2x2\n其它要求-根据图片1的角色和图片2的场景，参考图片3的模特的样貌发型发色。写四个有故事感和电影感的分镜，主要是展示服装，参考静奢风大片来写分镜。有人文风格和艺术感的场景。有创意的大透视大胆的构图，仰视、俯视等。不要耳环。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [425.3634033203125, 253.22669982910156], "pos": [-1019.5013427734375, 738.8565063476562], "id": 13, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [15, 16], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["pasted/8164691c2ad9cb17e10f07425e9d0b8b81fa64c4db3b5127d90788f1f5798a8b.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [230.07000732421875, 351.26800537109375], "pos": [-515.205322265625, 246.91221618652344], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "label": "可选连接", "type": "*"}], "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [282.56781005859375, 110.04777526855469], "color": "#323", "pos": [-1411.9105224609375, 263.4756164550781], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 17, "type": "Fast Groups By